"use strict";(self.webpackChunksmartcharts=self.webpackChunksmartcharts||[]).push([[826],{9358(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"-DI":"-DI","[symbol] feed is delayed by [delay] minutes":"le flux de [symbol] a \xe9t\xe9 retard\xe9 de [delay] minutes","[symbol] market is now opened.":"le march\xe9 [symbol] est maintenant ouvert.","[symbol] market is presently closed.":"Le march\xe9 [symbol] est actuellement ferm\xe9.","+DI":"+DI","2-Exponential":"2-Exponentiel","3-Exponential":"3-Exponentiel","A technical momentum indicator that compares a security\'s closing price to its price range over a given time period. The oscillator\'s sensitivity to market movements can be reduced by adjusting the time period or by taking a moving average of the result.":"Un indicateur de dynamique technique qui compare le prix de cl\xf4ture d\'un titre avec sa gamme de prix sur une p\xe9riode de temps donn\xe9e. La sensibilit\xe9 de l\'oscillateur aux mouvements du march\xe9 peut \xeatre r\xe9duite en modifiant la p\xe9riode de temps ou en prenant une moyenne mobile du r\xe9sultat.","Active":"Actif","Add new template":"Ajouter un mod\xe8le","Add new templates":"Ajouter des mod\xe8les","ADX":"ADX","ADX/DMS":"ADX/DMS","All drawings":"Tous les graphiques","Alligator":"Alligator","already exists.":"existe d\xe9ja.","Apply":"Postuler","Are you sure?":"Confirmez-vous ?","Area":"Zone","Area settings":"Param\xe8tres r\xe9gionaux","Aroon":"Aroon","Aroon Down":"Aroon Down","Aroon Up":"Aroon Up","Available only for \\\\\\"Area\\\\\\" chart type.":"Disponible uniquement pour le type de graphique \\\\\\"Zone\\\\\\".","Available only for non-tick time intervals.":"Disponible uniquement pour les intervalles de temps sans tick.","Awesome":"G\xe9nial","Awesome Oscillator":"Oscillateur Awesome","Axis Label":"\xc9tiquette de l\'axe","Back":"Retour","Base Line":"R\xe9f\xe9rence","Base Line Period":"Phase de r\xe9f\xe9rence","Bill Williams introduced the Alligator indicator in 1995. The Alligator is as much a metaphor as it is an indicator. It consists of three lines, overlaid on a pricing chart, that represent the jaw, the teeth and the lips of the beast, and was created to help the trader confirm the presence of a trend and its direction. The Alligator indicator can also help traders designate impulse and corrective wave formations, but the tool works best when combined with a momentum indicator.":"Bill Williams a introduit l\'indicateur Alligator en 1995. L\'Alligator est autant une m\xe9taphore qu\'un indicateur. Il est constitu\xe9 de trois lignes, superpos\xe9es sur un tableau des prix, qui repr\xe9sentent la m\xe2choire, les dents et les l\xe8vres de la b\xeate, et a \xe9t\xe9 cr\xe9\xe9 pour aider le trader \xe0 confirmer la pr\xe9sence d\'une tendance et sa direction. L\'indicateur Alligator peut \xe9galement aider les traders \xe0 d\xe9signer des formations de vagues d\'impulsions et de correction, mais l\'outil fonctionne mieux lorsqu\'il est combin\xe9 \xe0 un indicateur de momentum.","Blue":"Bleu","Bollinger Bands":"Bandes de Bollinger","Bollinger Bands Bottom":"Bandes de Bollinger Bas","Bollinger Bands can be used to measure the highness or lowness of the price relative to previous trades.":"Les bandes de Bollinger peuvent \xeatre utilis\xe9es pour mesurer la hauteur ou la faiblesse des prix par rapport aux trades pr\xe9c\xe9dents.","Bollinger Bands Median":"Bandes de Bollinger M\xe9dian","Bollinger Bands Top":"Bandes de Bollinger Haut","Cancel":"Annuler","Candle":"Bougie","CCI":"L\'ICC","Channel Fill":"Canal de Fill","Chart data is not available for this symbol.":"L\'information graphique n\'est pas disponible pour ce symbole.","Chart type":"Type de graphique","Chart types":"Types de graphique","Charts":"Graphiques","Clear all":"Tout effacer","Click on the chart to confirm point {{step}}.":"Cliquez sur le graphique pour confirmer le point {{step}}.","Click on the chart to confirm the end point.":"Cliquez sur le graphique pour confirmer le point final.","Click on the chart to confirm the start point.":"Cliquez sur le graphique pour confirmer le point de d\xe9part.","Click on the chart to place the line.":"Cliquez sur le graphique pour placer la ligne.","Close":"Fermeture","CLOSED":"FERM\xc9","Color":"Couleur","Commodity Channel Index":"Indice du Canal des Mati\xe8res Premi\xe8res","Continue":"Continuer","Conversion Line":"Transformation des valeurs","Conversion Line Period":"Phase de transformation des valeurs","CSV":"CSV","Dark":"Sombre","day":"jour","days":"jours","Decreasing Bar":"Barre descendante","Default":"Par d\xe9faut","Delete":"Supprimer","Detrended":"D\xe9tourn\xe9","Detrended Price Oscillator":"Oscillateur de prix \xe9liminant la tendance","Developed by Larry Williams, Williams %R is a momentum indicator that is the inverse of the Fast Stochastic Oscillator. Also referred to as %R, Williams %R reflects the level of the close relative to the highest high for the look-back period.":"D\xe9velopp\xe9 par Larry Williams, Williams %R est un indicateur d\'impulsion qui est l\'inverse de l\'Oscillateur Rapide Stochastique. Il est aussi appel\xe9 %R, Williams %R refl\xe8te le niveau de la cl\xf4ture par rapport au plus haut pour la p\xe9riode observ\xe9e.","Developed by Tushar Chande in 1995, Aroon is an indicator system that determines whether a stock is trending or not and how strong the trend is. There are two separate indicators: Aroon-Up and Aroon-Down. A 25-day Aroon-Up measures the number of days since a 25-day high. A 25-day Aroon-Down measures the number of days since a 25-day low.":"D\xe9velopp\xe9 par Tushar Chande en 1995, Aroon est un syst\xe8me indicateur qui d\xe9termine si l\'action est orient\xe9e \xe0 la hausse ou non et quel est la vigueur de la tendance. Il y a deux indicateurs s\xe9par\xe9s: Aroon-Haut et Aroon-Bas. Un Aroon-Haut de 25 jours mesure le nombre de jours depuis le plus haut parmi ces 25 jours. Un Aroon-Bas de 25 jours mesure le nombre de jours depuis le plus bas parmi ces 25 jours.","Disable Crosshair":"D\xe9sactiver la croix du curseur","Display data for a specific date and time":"Afficher les donn\xe9es pour une date et une heure pr\xe9cises","Display remaining time for each interval":"Afficher le temps restant pour chaque intervalle","Display the highest and lowest spot price":"Afficher le prix au comptant le plus \xe9lev\xe9 et le plus bas","Distance(%)":"Distance (%)","Donchian Channel":"Canal de Donchian","Donchian High":"Donchian \xc9lev\xe9","Donchian Low":"Donchian Faible","Donchian Median":"Donchian M\xe9dian","Done":"Termin\xe9","Double Smoothing Period":"P\xe9riode double de lissage","Download":"T\xe9l\xe9charger","Download your current chart view as a PNG or export the historical data for analysis as a CSV.":"T\xe9l\xe9chargez la vue actuelle de votre graphique au format PNG ou exportez les donn\xe9es historiques au format CSV pour les analyser.","Drawing tools":"Outils graphiques","Enable Crosshair":"Activer la croix du curseur","Exponential":"Exponentiel","Fast":"Rapide","Fast MA Period":"P\xe9riode rapide de la moyenne mobile","Favorites":"Favoris","Field":"Champ","Fill":"Remplir","Fill Color":"Couleur de remplissage","Fractal Channel":"Fractal Canal","Fractal Chaos Band":"Bandes de chaos fractal","Fractal High":"Fractal \xc9lev\xe9","Fractal Low":"Fractal Faible","Fractals are indicators on candlestick charts that identify reversal points in the market. Traders often use fractals to get an idea about the direction in which the price will develop. A fractal will form when a particular price pattern happens on a chart.":"Les fractales sont des indicateurs sur des graphiques en bougies qui identifient les points de retournement du march\xe9. Les traders souvent utilisent les fractales pour avoir une id\xe9e \xe0 propos de la direction dans laquelle le prix va se diriger. Un fractal se formera lorsqu\'un sch\xe9ma de prix particulier se produit sur le graphique.","Gradient":"Gradient","Green":"Vert","Guide":"Guide","H":"H","High":"Haut","High Period":"P\xe9riode \xe9lev\xe9e","Highest and lowest spot":"Point le plus haut et le plus bas","Histogram":"Histogramme","Historical data mode":"Mode de donn\xe9es historiques","Hl/2":"Hl/2","Hlc/3":"Hlc/3","Hlcc/4":"Hlcc/4","Hollow":"Vide","Horizontal line [num]":"Ligne horizontale [num]","hour":"heure","hours":"heures","Hull":"Coque","Ichimoku Clouds":"Ichimoku Clouds","Increasing Bar":"Barre montante","Indicators":"Indicateurs","Interval duration":"Dur\xe9e du l\'intervalle","Jaw":"M\xe2choire","Jaw Offset":"Compensation m\xe2choire","Jaw Period":"P\xe9riode m\xe2choire","L":"L","Lagging Span":"\xc9chelonn\xe9e et retard\xe9e","Lagging Span Period":"Phase retard\xe9e et \xe9chelonn\xe9e","Language":"Langue","Last digits stats for latest 1000 ticks on":"Statistiques du dernier chiffre pour les derniers 1000 ticks sur","Leading Span A":"Principale et \xe9chelonn\xe9e A","Leading Span B":"Principale et \xe9chelonn\xe9e B","Leading Span B Period":"Phase principale et \xe9chelonn\xe9e B","Light":"Vif","Line only":"Ligne uniquement","Line thickness":"\xc9paisseur de la ligne","Lips":"L\xe8vres","Lips Offset":"Compensation l\xe8vres","Lips Period":"P\xe9riode l\xe8vres","Low":"Bas","Low Period":"P\xe9riode creuse","MA":"Moyenne mobile","MA Env":"MA Env","MA Env Bottom":"Enveloppe de la moyenne mobile Bas","MA Env Median":"Enveloppe de la moyenne mobile M\xe9dian","MA Env Top":"Enveloppe de la moyenne mobile Haut","MACD":"MACD","MACD is a trading indicator used in technical analysis of stock prices. It is supposed to reveal changes in the strength, direction, momentum, and duration of a trend in a stock\'s price.":"MACD est un indicateur de trading utilis\xe9 dans l\'analyse technique de prix des actions. Il est cens\xe9 r\xe9v\xe9ler des changements dans la force, la direction, le momentum, et la dur\xe9e de tendance des prix de l\'action.","Markets":"March\xe9s","Maximum AF":"FA maximum","Medium":"Moyen","Minimum AF":"FA minimum","minute":"minute","minutes":"minutes","Momentum":"Momentum","Moving Average (MA)":"Moyenne Mobile (AM)","Moving Average Envelope":"Enveloppe de moyenne mobile","Moving Average Type":"Type de moyenne mobile","Moving averages":"Moyennes mobiles","Negative Bar":"Barre n\xe9gative","Network status":"Statut r\xe9seau","No drawing tool added yet":"Aucun outil de dessin n\'a encore \xe9t\xe9 ajout\xe9","No indicator added yet":"Aucun indicateur n\'a encore \xe9t\xe9 ajout\xe9","No results for \\\\\\"[text]\\\\\\"":"Aucun r\xe9sultat pour \xab [texte] \xbb","Offset":"D\xe9calage","OHLC":"OHLC","Ohlc/4":"Ohlc/4","Only selected charts and time intervals are available for this trade type.":"Seuls certains graphiques et intervalles de temps sont disponibles pour ce type de transaction.","Open":"Ouverture","Opens in:":"Ouverture dans :","Orange":"Orange","Others":"Autres","OverBought":"Surachet\xe9","OverSold":"Survendu","Overwrite":"\xc9craser","Parabolic SAR":"Parabolique SAR","Percent":"Pourcentage","Period":"P\xe9riode","Platform settings":"Param\xe8tres de la plateforme","PNG":"PNG","Point":"Point","Positive Bar":"Barre positive","Price Rate of Change":"Taux de Variation du Prix","Price ROC":"Prix ROC","PSAR":"PSAR","Purple":"Violet","Rainbow MA":"MM Arc-en-ciel","Rainbow Moving Average":"Moyenne mobile arc-en-ciel","Red":"Rouge","Relative Strength Index (RSI)":"Indice de Force Relative (RSI)","removed":"supprim\xe9","Reset":"R\xe9initialiser","Retrieving Chart Data...":"R\xe9cup\xe9ration des donn\xe9es du graphique...","Retrieving Chart Engine...":"R\xe9cup\xe9ration du moteur graphique...","Retrieving Market Symbols...":"R\xe9cup\xe9ration des Symboles du March\xe9...","Retrieving Trading Times...":"R\xe9cup\xe9ration des Temps de Trading...","RSI":"RSI","Saved templates":"Mod\xe8les sauvegard\xe9s","Scale to fit data":"Ajuster la taille en fonction des donn\xe9es","Search":"Rechercher","Search...":"Rechercher...","Select language":"S\xe9lectionnez une langue","Select theme":"S\xe9lectionnez un th\xe8me","Series":"S\xe9rie","Settings":"Param\xe8tres","Shading":"Ombrage","Shift":"D\xe9placement","Shift Type":"Type de d\xe9placement","Show Fractals":"Afficher les fractales","Show Lines":"Afficher les lignes","Show Zones":"Afficher les zones","Signal":"Signal","Signal Period":"P\xe9riode du signal","Simple":"Simple","Size":"Volume","Slow":"Lent","Slow MA Period":"P\xe9riode lente de la moyenne mobile","SMA1":"SMA1","SMA10":"SMA10","SMA2":"SMA2","SMA3":"SMA3","SMA4":"SMA4","SMA5":"SMA5","SMA6":"SMA6","SMA7":"SMA7","SMA8":"SMA8","SMA9":"SMA9","Smooth":"Smooth","Smoothing Period":"P\xe9riode de lissage","Some of your active indicators don’t support 1-tick intervals. If you change to a 1-tick interval, these indicators will be removed from your chart.":"Certains de vos indicateurs actifs ne supportent pas les intervalles d\'1 tick. Si vous passez \xe0 un intervalle d\'1 tick, ces indicateurs seront supprim\xe9s de votre graphique.","Some of your templates may not work with this trade type.":"Certains de vos mod\xe8les peuvent ne pas fonctionner avec ce type de transaction.","Standard Deviations":"\xc9carts types","Stch Mtm":"Stch Mtm","Stochastic":"Stochastique","Stochastic Momentum Index":"Indice de Momentum Stochastique","Stochastic Oscillator":"Oscillateur stochastique","Streaming for [symbol] is not available due to license restrictions":"Diffusion en continu pour [symbol] n’est pas disponible en raison de restrictions de licence","Teeth":"Dents","Teeth Offset":"D\xe9calage dents","Teeth Period":"P\xe9riode des dents","Templates":"Mod\xe8les","The Average Directional Movement Index index (ADX) was developed in 1978 by J. Welles Wilder as an indicator of trend strength in a series of prices of a financial instrument ADX will range between 0 and 100. Generally, ADX readings below 20 indicate trend weakness, and readings above 40 indicate trend strength.":"L\'indice de mouvement directionnel moyen (ADX) a \xe9t\xe9 d\xe9velopp\xe9 en 1978 par J. Welles Wilder comme indicateur de la force d\'une tendance dans une s\xe9rie de prix d\'un instrument financier. L\'ADX varie entre 0 et 100. En g\xe9n\xe9ral, les valeurs ADX inf\xe9rieures \xe0 20 indiquent une tendance faible, et les valeurs au-dessus de 40 indiquent une tendance forte.","The Awesome Oscillator is an indicator used to measure market momentum. AO calculates the difference of a 34 Period and 5 Period Simple Moving Averages. The Simple Moving Averages that are used are not calculated using closing price but rather each bar\'s midpoints. AO is generally used to affirm trends or to anticipate possible reversals.":"L\'Awesome Oscillator est un indicateur utilis\xe9 pour mesurer le momentum du march\xe9. L\'AO calcule la diff\xe9rence entre une moyenne mobile simple de 34 p\xe9riodes et une moyenne mobile simple de 5 p\xe9riodes. Les moyennes mobiles simples utilis\xe9es ne sont pas calcul\xe9es en utilisant le prix de cl\xf4ture, mais plut\xf4t les points m\xe9dians de chaque barre. L\'AO est g\xe9n\xe9ralement utilis\xe9 pour confirmer les tendances ou pour anticiper d\'\xe9ventuels retournements.","The Commodity Channel Index (CCI) is a versatile indicator that can be used to identify a new trend or warn of extreme conditions.":"L\'Indice du Canal des Mati\xe8res Premi\xe8res (CCI) est un indicateur polyvalent qui peut \xeatre utilis\xe9 pour identifier une nouvelle tendance ou avertir de conditions extr\xeames.","The Detrended Price Oscillator (DPO) helps to identify price cycles without the influence of short- and long-term trends. The DPO compares a simple moving average to a historical pricenear the middle of a specified period. It also shows the peaks and drops over that particular period, making it easier to predict buy points.":"L\'oscillateur de prix d\xe9tendu (DPO) aide \xe0 identifier les cycles de prix sans l\'influence des tendances \xe0 court et \xe0 long terme. Le DPO compare une moyenne mobile simple \xe0 un prix historique au milieu d\'une p\xe9riode donn\xe9e. Il montre \xe9galement les pics et les baisses au cours de cette p\xe9riode particuli\xe8re, ce qui facilite la pr\xe9diction des points d\'achat.","The Donchian Channel is an indicator used in market trading developed by Richard Donchian. It is formed by taking the highest high and the lowest low of the last n periods. The area between the high and the low is the channel for the period chosen.":"Le canal de Donchian est un indicateur utilis\xe9 dans le march\xe9 du trading d\xe9velopp\xe9 par Richard Donchian. Il se forme en prenant le plus haut et le plus bas des derni\xe8res p\xe9riodes n. La zone entre le plus haut et le plus bas est le canal pour la p\xe9riode choisie.","The Ichimoku Cloud, also known as Ichimoku Kinko Hyo, is a versatile indicator that defines support and resistance, identifies trend direction, gauges momentum and provides trading signals. Ichimoku Kinko Hyo translates into “one look equilibrium chart”.":"Le nuage Ichimoku, \xe9galement connu sous le nom d\'Ichimoku Kinko Hyo, est un indicateur polyvalent qui d\xe9finit le support et la r\xe9sistance, identifie la direction de la tendance, \xe9value l\'\xe9lan et fournit des signaux de trading. Ichimoku Kinko Hyo se traduit par \xabun graphique d\'\xe9quilibre en un seul regard\xbb.","The Moving Average (MA) helps to identify the overall market trend by filtering out short-term price fluctuations. Using historical data, it calculates the average price over a specific period and plots a line on the chart. If the MA line moves upwards, it’s an indicator of an uptrend, a downtrend if it moves downwards. A buy signal occurs when the price moves above the MA line.":"La moyenne mobile (MA) aide \xe0 identifier la tendance globale du march\xe9 en filtrant les fluctuations de prix \xe0 court terme. \xc0 l\'aide de donn\xe9es historiques, il calcule le prix moyen sur une p\xe9riode sp\xe9cifique et trace une ligne sur le graphique. Si la ligne MA se d\xe9place vers le haut, c\'est un indicateur d\'une tendance haussi\xe8re, une tendance baissi\xe8re si elle se d\xe9place vers le bas. Un signal d\'achat se produit lorsque le prix se d\xe9place au-dessus de la ligne MA.","The Moving Average Envelope (MAE) helps to identify strong price movement that indicates the start of a trend. The MAE creates a moving average line as well as 2 bands around it. In theory, when the market price touches the upper or lower bands, a trend reversal will occur, indicating a buy signal.":"L\'enveloppe moyenne mobile (MAE) permet d\'identifier un mouvement de prix important qui indique le d\xe9but d\'une tendance. Le MAE cr\xe9e une ligne moyenne mobile ainsi que 2 bandes autour d\'elle. En th\xe9orie, lorsque le prix du march\xe9 touche les bandes sup\xe9rieures ou inf\xe9rieures, une inversion de tendance se produit, indiquant un signal d\'achat.","The parabolic SAR is calculated almost independently for each trend in the price. When the price is in an uptrend, the SAR emerges below the price and converges upwards towards it. Similarly, on a downtrend, the SAR emerges above the price and converges downwards. At each step within a trend, the SAR is calculated one period in advance.":"Le SAR parabolique est calcul\xe9 presque ind\xe9pendamment pour chaque tendance du prix. Lorsque le prix est dans une tendance haussi\xe8re, le SAR appara\xeet en dessous du prix et converge vers le haut. De m\xeame, dans une tendance baissi\xe8re, le SAR appara\xeet au-dessus du prix et converge vers le bas. \xc0 chaque \xe9tape d\'une tendance, le SAR est calcul\xe9 une p\xe9riode \xe0 l\'avance.","The Price Rate-of-Change (ROC) indicator displays the difference between the current price and the price x-time periods ago. The difference can be displayed in either points or as a percentage.":"L\'indicateur de Taux de Variation du Prix (ROC) affiche la diff\xe9rence entre le prix actuel et le prix d\'il y a x p\xe9riodes. La diff\xe9rence peut \xeatre affich\xe9e soit en points, soit en pourcentage.","The Rainbow Moving Average (RMA) displays several moving average lines simultaneously. When the lines intersect, it’s an indicator of price reversal and the angle of the lines are helpful to predict the trend strength. The steeper the curve, the stronger the trend. When the price crosses the moving average lines from below, it signals an upward trend. When the price crosses the moving average lines from above, it signals a downward trend. The RMA is easier to use compared to using several different moving average indicators at once.":"La Rainbow Moving Average (RMA) affiche plusieurs lignes de moyenne mobile simultan\xe9ment. Lorsque les lignes se croisent, c\'est un indicateur d\'inversion de prix et l\'angle des lignes est utile pour pr\xe9dire la force de la tendance. Plus la courbe est raide, plus la tendance est forte. Lorsque le prix franchit les lignes moyennes mobiles par le bas, il signale une tendance \xe0 la hausse. Lorsque le prix franchit les lignes moyennes mobiles d\'en haut, il signale une tendance \xe0 la baisse. Le RMA est plus facile \xe0 utiliser que d\'utiliser plusieurs indicateurs de moyenne mobile diff\xe9rents \xe0 la fois.","The Relative Strength Index (RSI) was published by J. Welles Wilder. The current price is normalized as a percentage between 0 and 100. The name of this oscillator is misleading because it does not compare the instrument relative to another instrument or set of instruments, but rather represents the current price relative to other recent prices within the selected lookback window length.":"L\'indice de force relative (RSI) a \xe9t\xe9 publi\xe9 par J. Welles Wilder. Le cours actuel est normalis\xe9 en pourcentage entre 0 et 100. Le nom de cet oscillateur est trompeur car il ne compare pas l\'instrument par rapport \xe0 un autre instrument ou un ensemble d\'instruments, mais repr\xe9sente plut\xf4t le cours actuel par rapport \xe0 d\'autres prix r\xe9cents \xe0 l\'int\xe9rieur de la longueur de la fen\xeatre de retour s\xe9lectionn\xe9e.","The Stochastic Momentum Index (SMI) helps to identify overbought or oversold conditions in the market and to predict bearish or bullish trends. It calculates the distance between the current closing price and the median of the high/low range, and displays 2 lines on the chart: the first (known as %K) represents the price movement while the second (known as %D) is a moving average of the first line. If the closing price is higher than the median of the high/low range, the SMI returns a positive value. If the closing price is lower than the average price, a negative value is returned. Values above 40 indicate a bullish trend while values below -40 indicate a bearish trend.":"L\'indice Stochastic Momentum (SMI) aide \xe0 identifier les conditions de surachat ou de survente sur le march\xe9 et \xe0 pr\xe9dire les tendances baissi\xe8res ou haussi\xe8res. Il calcule la distance entre le cours de cl\xf4ture actuel et la m\xe9diane de la fourchette haute / basse, et affiche 2 lignes sur le graphique: la premi\xe8re (connue sous le nom de% K) repr\xe9sente le mouvement des prix tandis que la seconde (connue sous le nom de% D) est un moyenne mobile de la premi\xe8re ligne. Si le cours de cl\xf4ture est sup\xe9rieur \xe0 la m\xe9diane de la fourchette haute / basse, le SMI renvoie une valeur positive. Si le cours de cl\xf4ture est inf\xe9rieur au prix moyen, une valeur n\xe9gative est renvoy\xe9e. Les valeurs sup\xe9rieures \xe0 40 indiquent une tendance haussi\xe8re tandis que les valeurs inf\xe9rieures \xe0 -40 indiquent une tendance baissi\xe8re.","Themes":"Th\xe8mes","There are no favorites yet.":"Il n’y a pas encore de favoris.","Thick":"\xc9pais","Thin":"Fin","This indicator does not support 1-tick intervals. To use this indicator, change your chart time interval to 1 minute or more.":"Cet indicateur ne supporte pas les intervalles d\'1tick. Pour utiliser cet indicateur, changez l\'intervalle de temps de votre graphique \xe0 1 minute ou plus.","tick":"tick","Time interval":"Intervalle de temps","Time Series":"S\xe9ries chronologiques","Trend":"Tendance","Trend line [num]":"Ligne de tendance [num]","Triangular":"Triangulaire","Try checking your spelling or use a different term":"Essayez de v\xe9rifier votre orthographe ou utilisez un terme diff\xe9rent","Type":"Type","Variable":"Variable","Vertical line [num]":"Ligne verticale [num]","Volatility":"Volatilit\xe9","Weighted":"Pond\xe9r\xe9","Welles Wilder":"Welles Wilder","What is [name]?":"Qu\'est-ce que [nom] ?","William\'s %R":"William\'s %R","William\'s Percent Range":"Pourcentage de William","Would you like to overwrite it?":"Aimeriez-vous le remplacer ?","You can add up to [count] indicators.":"Vous pouvez ajouter jusqu\'\xe0 [count] indicateurs.","You have no saved templates yet.":"Vous n\'avez pas encore enregistr\xe9 de mod\xe8le.","Zero Lag":"Z\xe9ro lag","Zig Zag":"Zig Zag","Zig Zag helps to identify trend reversals and filters out relatively small price movements by determining the support and resistance levels of the market. It accepts a percentage of deviation as the input and displays a line if the price change is larger than the percentage of deviation. Zig Zag ignores any sideways movement and is useful to filter out “market noise”.":"Zig Zag aide \xe0 identifier les inversions de tendance et filtre les mouvements de prix relativement petits en d\xe9terminant les niveaux de support et de r\xe9sistance du march\xe9. Il accepte un pourcentage d\'\xe9cart comme entr\xe9e et affiche une ligne si le changement de prix est sup\xe9rieur au pourcentage d\'\xe9cart. Zig Zag ignore tout mouvement lat\xe9ral et est utile pour filtrer le \xabbruit du march\xe9\xbb.","Zoom in":"Effectuer un zoom avant","Zoom out":"Effectuer un zoom arri\xe8re"}')}}]);